sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant J as Jarvis
  participant C as Council
  participant G as Government
  participant N as Necromancer
  participant B as Business Registry
  participant A as Agents
  participant M as Memory
  participant D as Dashboard

  U->>J: I have an idea
  J->>M: Recall relevant memory
  J->>C: Ask for strategic review if needed
  C-->>J: Options, risks, direction
  J->>G: Check creation policy
  G-->>J: Allowed
  J->>N: Propose agent team
  N-->>J: Agent team blueprint
  J->>B: Create ecosystem business
  B->>A: Create default agents
  A->>A: Generate spec/tasks/research/risks
  A->>M: Store decisions and artifacts
  A->>D: Update dashboard
  J-->>U: Business ready, approval needed for next actions
